From 77dbbf58d05474047e46c390644309bbc1fa607f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: LukeParkerDev <10430890+Hona@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 10:30:02 +1000
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] ci(release): build, sign, publish and gate browser
 engines

Build, sign, verify and atomically publish the four buildable browser
engines (windows-x64, windows-arm64, macos-arm64, linux-x64) to
opencode-rune/browser-engine/stable, and block publish-desktop unless
the live index serves this commit's exact engine version across all
four targets, matches the Linux x64 sha256 pin, and source.rs sets
the release defaults for Windows, macOS arm64, and Linux x86_64.

Leaves the existing manual engine-linux preview jobs untouched; the
following commit retires them separately.
